            "id": "20261119A03RQW00",
            "title": "道指深夜跌超560点，半导体股跳水，英伟达市值蒸发超7200亿元，热门中概股走低，爱奇艺跌超16%",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OJTgOS_XnA038cVA49aY6kp_sWsxkObDtJV4alEH66yjUAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261119A03RQW00",
            "author": "名扬四海",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 06:55:33",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(62, 62, 62);font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:justify;text-autospace:normal\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;padding:0px 10px\"><p><span data-pm-slice='1 1 [\"para\",{\"tagName\":\"section\",\"attributes\":{\"style\":\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;\",\"data-pm-slice\":\"0 0 []\"},\"namespaceURI\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\",\"data-layout-id\":null},\"para\",{\"tagName\":\"section\",\"attributes\":{\"style\":\"color: rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 1.8;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"},\"namespaceURI\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\",\"data-layout-id\":null},\"para\",{\"tagName\":\"p\",\"attributes\":{},\"namespaceURI\":\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\",\"data-layout-id\":null}]'>据21财经雷达，</span><span>美东时间周三，<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">美股三大股指收盘涨跌不一</span>，道琼斯指数日内跌超560点，跌幅1.11%，为6月11日以来的最低收盘价；标普500指数跌0.23%，连续五个交易日收低；<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">纳斯达克</span></span></span>综合指数涨0.42%。美联储最新会议纪要显示，一些官员称12月加息超过25个基点或是合理的，几乎所有官员都认为采取进一步行动或是合适的。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">具体来看，</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">科技七巨头多数收涨</span>，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">亚马逊</span></span></span>涨近4%，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">特斯拉</span></span></span>涨近1%，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">谷歌</span></span></span>、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">微软</span></span></span>、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">苹果</span></span></span>跟涨；<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">英伟达</span></span></span>领跌，Meta跟跌。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">费城半导体指数盘中跳水</span>，最终小幅收涨0.1%。<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">存储芯片股走势分化，</span></span><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span>英伟达跌近3%，</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;text-autospace:normal\">创</span><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;text-align:justify;text-autospace:normal\"><span>2025年6月以来的最低水平，一夜市值蒸发约1085亿美元（约合人民币超7200亿元)</span></span></strong><span>，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">其最新财报大幅超预期，公司日赚超46亿元，毛利率近75%，董事长称无意让黄仁勋回任</span></span></span>。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">应用光电</span></span></span>跌近10%，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">高通</span></span></span>跌超4%，闪迪跌超2%，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">美光科技</span></span></span>跌1%，英特尔跌近1%。上涨方面，AMD逆势涨超5%，博通涨超3%。<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">光通信股多数走低</span>，AAOI跌近10%，迈威尔科技跌超2%，Lumentum跌超1.5%。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:0;text-align:center\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:auto;line-height:0;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:95%\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OlThinfI7FC_WNsW3znY9tDBcWPFA-2MmYmQ3bTQ4I2jsAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/OlThinfI7FC_WNsW3znY9tDBcWPFA-2MmYmQ3bTQ4I2jsAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;line-height:0;text-align:center\"><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;display:inline-block;height:auto;line-height:0;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:95%\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O5iEVeLdRnD7rNQ9gmy24QhD0T2_3JIwsQBMNDZPlQbuYAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/O5iEVeLdRnD7rNQ9gmy24QhD0T2_3JIwsQBMNDZPlQbuYAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;vertical-align:middle;width:100%;height:100%\"/></section></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;padding:0px 10px\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;padding:0px 10px\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">中概股多数收跌</span>，纳斯达克中国金龙指数跌1.35%。<span style=\"font-weight:bold\">爱奇艺重挫逾16%领跌</span>，智能未来、世纪互联等跌超10%，百度集团、阿里巴巴、腾讯控股—ADR、京东集团跌超2%；天演药业逆势大涨近23%，虎牙涨超6%，禾赛科技、亚朵、Boss直聘涨幅居前。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p></section><section style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);letter-spacing:1px;line-height:1.8;padding:0px 10px\"><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:border-box\"><span>能源股、黄金股全线收跌，</span></strong><span>西方石油跌近5%，埃克森美孚、雪佛龙跌近4%，伊格尔矿业、盎格鲁黄金、纽蒙特矿业跌超6%。国际油价、国际金银同步下挫，黄金一夜跌超120美元，击穿3730美元/盎司，创14月新低。</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;white-space:normal\"><span><br/></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:1px;margin:0px;max-width:100%;min-height:1em;orphans:2;outline:0px;padding:0px;text-align:center;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(25, 67, 115);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><strong style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\"><span style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin:0px;max-width:100%;outline:0px;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow-wrap:break-word !important\">你看好存储芯片后市吗？</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:border-box;clear:both;color:rgb(56, 54, 53);f